     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>I have this main Rnw file:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">documentclass</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">article</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#008\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">document</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">section</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Using</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> knit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">_expand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;&gt;&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> knit_expand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;child.Rnw&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">@</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sexpr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">knit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> collapse </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;\\n&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">section</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Using</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> knit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">_child</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;&gt;&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> knit_child</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;child.Rnw&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quiet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">@</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sexpr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">knit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">text </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> collapse </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;\\n&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#008\">end</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">document</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>And <b>child.Rnw</b>:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">texttt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{\\{\\{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\}\\}}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}}.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">medskip <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">texttt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sexpr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">}.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">\\</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bigskip</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>This is the output when I knit the main Rnw:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-8omeEferU-M/WG0FWnOtKcI/AAAAAAAAAHU/ra-2ocqXYpMWU3VYfCW37jePVe97lwplwCLcB/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-8omeEferU-M/WG0FWnOtKcI/AAAAAAAAAHU/ra-2ocqXYpMWU3VYfCW37jePVe97lwplwCLcB/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792354688264000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0YWW6anDpJe5Tqv-w3hnZn\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-8omeEferU-M/WG0FWnOtKcI/AAAAAAAAAHU/ra-2ocqXYpMWU3VYfCW37jePVe97lwplwCLcB/s400/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"342\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I don&#39;t understand why &quot;value&quot; is always &quot;2&quot; with knit_expand. Can someone explain that ? Thanks.</div></div>"
